---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Guiding Point Consulting | Human-Centered Web + AI Systems"
  description="Guiding Point Consulting bridges tech, creativity, and human connection for public sector prime contractors and mission-driven nonprofits. AI is getting smarter. We build the systems that keep people at the center of it."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container hero-content">
      <h1>About Guiding Point</h1>
      <p class="hero-text">
        Technology should bring people closer not replace the connection between them. Guiding Point Consulting was built on that belief, partnering with public sector prime contractors and mission-driven nonprofits to modernize digital systems without losing what makes their organizations human.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Our role is to strengthen delivery by improving how organizations communicate, manage content, and operate their digital systems without adding unnecessary complexity to the teams who have to live with the results.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-tagline">Bridging tech, creativity, and human connection.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Opening -->
  <section class="opening-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-section">
        <p class="large-text">
          Guiding Point Consulting exists for the moments when "just update the website" turns into late-night edits, unclear ownership, and content that never quite reflects the mission everyone is working toward. We sit between leadership, program staff, and technical teams to translate goals into systems, roadmaps, and execution plans that actually hold up, whether we are supporting a public sector prime contractor as a delivery subcontractor or working directly with a mission-driven nonprofit to improve their digital presence.
        </p>
        <p class="large-text positioning-line">
          AI is getting smarter. We build the systems that keep people at the center of it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission + Why Guiding Point -->
  <section class="mission-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mission-grid">

        <div class="mission-block">
          <h2>Our Mission</h2>
          <p>We are committed to strengthening communities by helping the organizations that serve them communicate clearly, work smarter, and use technology in a way that feels human, not overwhelming.</p>
          <p>When the path forward is unclear, the gaps feel too wide, or the bottlenecks will not budge, we show up as the guiding point, bridging technology, creativity, and human connection to help mission-driven organizations move from where they are to where they need to be.</p>
          <p class="mission-belief">"AI is getting smarter. We build the systems that keep people at the center of it."</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mission-block">
          <h2>Why "Guiding Point"</h2>
          <p>A guiding point is what you look for when you are navigating uncertain terrain a fixed, reliable marker that helps you find your direction and keep moving forward with confidence.</p>
          <p>For nonprofits and mission-driven teams, that moment often looks like this: the website no longer reflects who you are, AI tools are sitting unused because no one knows where to start, or the gap between the organization's vision and what the team can actually execute keeps growing wider.</p>
          <p>Through this work, it became clear that many organizations and the contractors supporting them struggle with the same challenges: unclear messaging, inefficient workflows, and difficulty adopting new technologies in a way that still feels human. That is exactly where we come in.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Meet the Founder -->
  <section class="founder-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Meet the Founder</h2>
      <div class="founder-grid">

        <div class="founder-photo">
          <img src="/images/headshot-placeholder.png" alt="Zipporah Banyay, Founder of Guiding Point Consulting" class="headshot-img" />
          <div class="founder-name-block">
            <h3>Zipporah Banyay</h3>
            <p class="founder-title">Founder and CEO, Guiding Point Consulting LLC</p>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/zipporahbanyay/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="linkedin-link">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"/>
              </svg>
              Connect on LinkedIn
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="founder-bio">
          <p>
            Zipporah Banyay is a technical integrations professional, full stack JavaScript developer, and digital strategist whose career began in marketing and never fully left it. Over seven years, she has built a rare combination of creative instinct, client fluency, and hands-on technical depth that shapes everything Guiding Point delivers.
          </p>
          <p>
            Her foundation is in marketing. She started working with entrepreneurs and small businesses as an independent consultant, helping them grow through multi-channel strategy: brand development, content creation, paid advertising, SEO, and analytics. That early work taught her something that still drives how she operates today: the most powerful thing you can give a team is not just a better tool, but a clearer system and the confidence to use it.
          </p>
          <p>
            From there, she moved into account management roles inside digital marketing agencies, where she spent years as the primary point of contact for SMB and enterprise clients overseeing website builds, digital advertising campaigns, content operations, cross-platform integrations, and performance reporting. She learned what it looks like when strategy and execution fall out of alignment, and how to fix it without losing the client relationship in the process.
          </p>
          <p>
            Along the way, she developed a parallel track in IT and technical support working inside enterprise environments managing systems, access controls, onboarding, and SOPs. That experience gave her a working understanding of infrastructure that most marketers never develop, and it permanently changed how she thinks about digital systems and sustainability.
          </p>
          <p>
            When AI started reshaping content operations, she leaned in. She pursued full stack web development training earning certifications in JavaScript, React, Node.js, MongoDB, and REST APIs and began building and deploying the kind of technical integrations she had previously scoped and handed off. Today she configures analytics stacks, builds authentication flows, manages CI/CD pipelines, and implements the same CRM and platform integrations she once briefed developers to handle.
          </p>
          <p>
            That combination marketing operations fluency, client-facing experience, and genuine technical depth is what makes Guiding Point's work different. Zipporah does not just recommend systems. She builds them, documents them, and trains the teams who will maintain them long after the engagement ends.
          </p>
          <p class="founder-credentials">
            Degree in Business and Marketing · Full Stack Web Development Certification · Google IT Support Certificate · Foundations of UX Design · 14 total professional certifications in IT, data analytics, web development, and more.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How We Work with Public Sector Prime Contractors -->
  <section class="govcon-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="govcon-title">How We Work with Public Sector Prime Contractors</h2>
      <p class="govcon-lead">
        Guiding Point Consulting integrates into prime-led teams as a specialized subcontractor, supporting the digital and AI components of contract delivery that are often underserved or difficult to staff internally.
      </p>
      <p class="govcon-body">
        We focus on areas such as website modernization, digital systems, content workflows, and AI adoption helping ensure that deliverables are not only completed, but usable, sustainable, and effective for the communities and organizations being served. The prime stays on contract and leads delivery. We handle the digital and AI execution.
      </p>
      <div class="govcon-points">
        <div class="govcon-point">
          <h3>We integrate, not compete</h3>
          <p>We align with your scope, timelines, and reporting structure. Our goal is to make your delivery stronger not to add friction or compete for the prime relationship.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="govcon-point">
          <h3>We fill real capability gaps</h3>
          <p>Website modernization, AI workflow implementation, content systems, and team training are areas that are often hard to staff internally. That is exactly where we plug in.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="govcon-point">
          <h3>We build for sustainability</h3>
          <p>Every system we deliver is documented and designed for the teams who will maintain it after the contract wraps. No black boxes, no vendor lock-in, and no loss of the human layer that makes the work matter.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Slideshow Section -->
  <section class="slideshow-section" aria-label="Work moments slideshow">
    <div class="slideshow-track">

      <div class="slide active">
        <div class="slide-bg slide-img-1">
          <div class="slide-overlay"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="slide-caption">
          <span class="caption-tag">In the Field</span>
          <p>Working alongside teams to map the content workflows that actually happen day to day.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="slide">
        <div class="slide-bg slide-img-2">
          <div class="slide-overlay"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="slide-caption">
          <span class="caption-tag">Strategy Sessions</span>
          <p>Turning leadership goals into roadmaps teams can follow without a 40-slide deck.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="slide">
        <div class="slide-bg slide-img-3">
          <div class="slide-overlay"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="slide-caption">
          <span class="caption-tag">Training in Action</span>
          <p>Helping program and comms staff use AI safely and confidently in their day-to-day work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="slide">
        <div class="slide-bg slide-img-4">
          <div class="slide-overlay"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="slide-caption">
          <span class="caption-tag">Community First</span>
          <p>Every system we build is designed for the real people your organization exists to serve.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <button class="slide-btn slide-prev" aria-label="Previous slide">&#8592;</button>
    <button class="slide-btn slide-next" aria-label="Next slide">&#8594;</button>

    <div class="slide-dots" role="tablist">
      <button class="dot active" aria-label="Slide 1" role="tab"></button>
      <button class="dot" aria-label="Slide 2" role="tab"></button>
      <button class="dot" aria-label="Slide 3" role="tab"></button>
      <button class="dot" aria-label="Slide 4" role="tab"></button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What You Can Expect + Tools -->
  <section class="about-content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-grid">

        <div class="content-block">
          <h2>What You Can Expect</h2>
          <p class="intro-text">
            Whether you are a prime bringing us into a contract or an organization we are serving directly, you get a partner who cares about how the work holds up for the teams behind it.
          </p>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>Clear scope, steady communication, and realistic expectations from day one.</li>
            <li>Human-centered messaging and UX that respects your audience's time, trust, and lived experience.</li>
            <li>Systems thinking instead of one-off pages and random acts of content.</li>
            <li>Practical AI workflows with quality controls, guardrails, and governance not shiny tools with no structure.</li>
            <li>Training the organizations we support can actually follow, even on a busy Tuesday with no tech background.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="content-block">
          <h2>Tools, Strengths and Strategy</h2>
          <p class="intro-text">
            On any given engagement, we move between strategy, structure, and delivery across five core areas:
          </p>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li><strong>Website audits and modernization roadmaps</strong> clear, prioritized plans that improve clarity, usability, and AI discoverability for the organizations served.</li>
            <li><strong>AI-supported content operations</strong> SOPs, workflows, prompt kits, and governance that support the humans doing the work instead of replacing their judgment.</li>
            <li><strong>AI team training</strong> practical, role-specific guidance so staff can use AI safely and confidently in day-to-day work.</li>
            <li><strong>Custom mission-aware chatbots and AI assistants</strong> built from your FAQs, programs, and policies so visitors and staff get accurate answers fast.</li>
            <li><strong>Fractional Digital Strategy leadership</strong> ongoing senior guidance for nonprofits and subcontract digital strategy support for public sector primes.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Approach Section -->
  <section class="approach-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="approach-content">
        <h2>How We Work With Teams</h2>
        <p class="approach-intro">The throughline is simple: listen, simplify, then ship.</p>
        <div class="approach-grid">

          <div class="approach-item">
            <div class="approach-number">1</div>
            <h3>Listen First</h3>
            <p>We start by understanding the mission, goals, constraints, and team dynamics before proposing anything. We want to know what is working, what is not, and where the real friction lives.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="approach-item">
            <div class="approach-number">2</div>
            <h3>Systems Thinking</h3>
            <p>Every recommendation considers how it fits into broader workflows, staffing realities, compliance needs, and long-term goals. If it will not hold up six months after the engagement ends, it does not go in the plan.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="approach-item">
            <div class="approach-number">3</div>
            <h3>Ship and Iterate</h3>
            <p>We focus on getting something useful live, documented, and in the team's hands then improving based on real feedback and results. No endless cycles of almost done.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>Let's Work Together</h2>
        <p>If you are a public sector prime contractor looking for a reliable subcontractor to handle the digital and AI work your contract requires, that is exactly what Guiding Point is built for.</p>
        <p>If your website, content, or AI processes feel heavier than they should or if they're missing the human layer that makes them work we can help with that too. Let's start with a conversation.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .about-hero {
    background: var(--white);
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
  }

  .hero-content {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .hero-text {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-md);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--gray-700);
  }

  .hero-sub {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-lg);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--gray-600);
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
    background: rgba(50, 52, 90, 0.04);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--rust);
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rust);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ── Opening ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .opening-section {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0 0;
  }

  .content-section {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .large-text {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--gray-700);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .positioning-line {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--indigo);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-style: italic;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--rust);
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
  }

  /* ── Founder Section ─────────────────────────── */
  .founder-section {
    padding: var(--space-3xl) 0;
    background: var(--off-white);
  }

  .founder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: var(--space-xl) auto 0;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .founder-photo {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .headshot-img {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 4px solid var(--rust);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .founder-name-block {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .founder-name-block h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--indigo);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .founder-title {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--rust);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .linkedin-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--indigo);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--indigo);
    border-radius: 20px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .linkedin-link:hover {
    background: var(--indigo);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .founder-bio p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--gray-700);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .founder-bio p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .founder-credentials {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--gray-600);
    font-style: italic;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    padding-top: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ── GovCon Section ───────────────────────────── */
  .govcon-section {
    padding: var(--space-3xl) 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--indigo) 0%, #252742 100%);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .govcon-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    color: var(--white) !important;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .govcon-lead {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-md);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .govcon-body {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-xl);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .govcon-points {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .govcon-point {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .govcon-point h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .govcon-point p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  /* ── Section Title ───────────────────────────── */
  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    color: var(--indigo);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* ── Mission Section ─────────────────────────── */
  .mission-section {
    padding: var(--space-3xl) 0;
    background: var(--off-white);
  }

  .mission-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .mission-block {
    background: var(--white);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--rust);
  }

  .mission-block h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--indigo);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .mission-block p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--gray-700);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .mission-block p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .mission-belief {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--indigo) !important;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--rust);
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
  }

  /* ── About Content ───────────────────────────── */
  .about-content {
    padding: var(--space-3xl) 0;
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .content-block h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--indigo);
  }

  .intro-text {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--gray-700);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .check-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .check-list li {
    padding-left: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    position: relative;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--gray-700);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .check-list li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--rust);
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  /* ── Approach Section ────────────────────────── */
  .approach-section {
    padding: var(--space-3xl) 0;
    background: var(--gray-50);
  }

  .approach-content {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .approach-content h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--indigo);
  }

  .approach-intro {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--gray-700);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .approach-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .approach-item {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease;
  }

  .approach-item p {
    flex: 1;
    color: var(--gray-600);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .approach-item.animate {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .approach-item:nth-child(1).animate { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
  .approach-item:nth-child(2).animate { transition-delay: 0.4s; }
  .approach-item:nth-child(3).animate { transition-delay: 0.6s; }

  .approach-number {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    background: var(--rust);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .approach-item h3 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--indigo);
  }

  /* ── Slideshow ────────────────────────────────── */
  .slideshow-section {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 540px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #1a1a2e;
  }

  .slideshow-track {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .slide {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 1.2s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .slide.active {
    opacity: 1;
